# Allow-list: the build context holds only what the server image needs, so
# .env files, virtualenvs, recordings and model weights can never leak into it.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages/core/
!apps/server/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/tests/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
